<item>
            <title>[JGVT-2977] Balance Interface: Update Split Table - Select Balance from GMP or DEV Equipment Table/Worksheet and Auto-Import Balance (meta)data to GMP or DEV Preparation Sub table </title>
                <link>https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-2977</link>
                <project id="46901" key="JGVT">TDS - Revvity Signals ELN</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;As a User&lt;/b&gt;,&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;I want&#160;to&lt;/b&gt; be able to weigh the actual amount of my samples, containers and preparations using direct connected balances,&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;So that&lt;/b&gt;&#160;I can gather accurate weights.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Design Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Scope extension of existing Balance Interface Functionality:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-1504&quot; title=&quot;Balance Interface: Get Actual Amounts for direct weighing method&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-1504&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-1504&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - Scope Extension: Protocol should be able to retrieve Balance from Import Material/Lot/Container Worksheet with&#160; Template Name containing either &apos;GxP-DEV&apos; or &apos;GXP-GMP&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-1711&quot; title=&quot;Balance Interface: Auto-check the neg property in Preparations Sub Table&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-1711&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-1711&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - Scope Extension: Protocol should be able to populate Neg property of the Preparation Sub table with Template Name containing either &apos;GxP-DEV&apos; or &apos;GXP-GMP&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-1169&quot; title=&quot;Balance Interface: Auto-Calculate Fit for GxP field and Auto-populate Balance Data Field with Balance Interface metadata&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-1169&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-1169&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - Scope Extension: Protocol should be able to populate &apos;Balance data&apos; and &apos;Fit for GxP&apos; fields of the Preparation Sub table with Template Name containing either &apos;GxP-DEV&apos; or &apos;GXP-GMP&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-1504&quot; title=&quot;Balance Interface: Get Actual Amounts for direct weighing method&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-1504&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-1504&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-1552&quot; title=&quot;Balance Interface: Get weigh measures for Residual Difference weighing method &quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-1552&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-1552&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-1558&quot; title=&quot;Balance Interface: Get Weighing measures for Difference weighing method&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-1558&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-1558&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - Scope extension: Protocol should be able to populate Actual Amount field of the Preparation Sub table with Template Name containing either &apos;GxP-DEV&apos; or &apos;GXP-GMP&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Note:&#160;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;GxP-GMP Experiment template: Uses GxP-GMP Analytical Equipment Table embedded in Worksheet&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;GxP-DEV Experiment template: Uses GxP-DEV Analytical Equipment Table&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
