                <customfields>
                                                <customfield id="customfield_10300" key="com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.customfieldtypes:textarea">
                        <customfieldname>Acceptance Criteria</customfieldname>
                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;A Signals Experiment with
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;one or more hub-connected balances in the Analytical Equipment Table/Worksheet (Equipment Class = Balance)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Sub Preparation Tables (with external action)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The User has added one or more internal references to &apos;GxP CISPro Materials&apos;, &apos;GxP Biovia Samples &apos;or &apos;Signals Inventory&apos; in the Preparations Sub table.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The User has entered one or more &apos;Planned Amt&apos; as a weight in the Preparations Sub table.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt; a User triggers the external action on Preparation sub table and opens the Balance Interface&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;the User shall be able to Select any of the Balances from the Experiment&apos;s Equipment Table/Worksheet in the Interface.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The System shall auto-populate the &apos;Actual Amt&apos; property of the Preparations Sub table with the actual amount value shown in the Interface ((override values with most recent retrieved value).&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The System shall auto-check the &apos;Neg&apos; property of the Preparations Sub table when the retrieved balance actual amount value is negative. Note that in case a positive value is pulled in from the balance, that the system shall leave the Neg property unchecked.&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;the User shall notice that the System has auto-populated the following metadata in property &apos;Balance Data&apos; of the Preparations Sub table according to &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-1169&quot; title=&quot;Balance Interface: Auto-Calculate Fit for GxP field and Auto-populate Balance Data Field with Balance Interface metadata&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-1169&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-1169&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;the User shall notice that the System has auto-populated the &apos;Fit for GxP&apos; property of the Preparation Sub table according to &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-1169&quot; title=&quot;Balance Interface: Auto-Calculate Fit for GxP field and Auto-populate Balance Data Field with Balance Interface metadata&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-1169&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-1169&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</customfieldvalue>

                        </customfieldvalues>
                    </customfield>
